      "versionNonce": 2216,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790570000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ONLY writer of authoritative world state\nSubmit(actorId, action, deltaSeconds) | one API\ninput journal -> replay through same API\nop + typed target + modifiers\nvalidate -> resolve -> commit -> enqueue events\nactor body contact blocks movement\ndig/build work resumes by actor + target\nops.toml catalog | registered handlers\nactivities advance only on clock ticks\nSI physics | full action-time trajectories\ngenerated menus | Pick(ray) | SetGoal\nNewGame | EnsureWorld | deterministic\ngame clock: 1s = 1 min | pause / x1 / x3 / x10\ncurrent: move / inspect / wait / dig / climb / build",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ONLY writer of authoritative world state\nSubmit(actorId, action, deltaSeconds) | one API\ninput journal -> replay through same API\nop + typed target + modifiers\nvalidate -> resolve -> commit -> enqueue events\nactor body contact blocks movement\ndig/build work resumes by actor + target\nops.toml catalog | registered handlers\nactivities advance only on clock ticks\nSI physics | full action-time trajectories\ngenerated menus | Pick(ray) | SetGoal\nNewGame | EnsureWorld | deterministic\ngame clock: 1s = 1 min | pause / x1 / x3 / x10\ncurrent: move / inspect / wait / dig / climb / build",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
